sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Init as init()
    participant LL as LazyLock
    participant Env
    participant DB

    App->>Init: call
    Init->>LL: trigger eval
    LL->>Env: read configs
    LL->>DB: create pool
    LL-->>Init: ready
    Note over Init: Panic on<br>invalid config
    Init-->>App: Ok(())
